        "display": "would come",
        "explain": "‘Will’ moves back to ‘would’."
      },
      {
        "use": "Yes/No",
        "before": "“Is it raining?” → She asked if it",
        "after": ".",
        "hint": "(rain)",
        "answers": [
          "was raining"
        ],
        "display": "was raining",
        "explain": "Present continuous moves back: was raining."
      },
      {
        "use": "Wh-",
        "before": "“Where do you live?” → He asked where I",
